MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: CH3-LVL2-SCENE2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Nemestra's beasts are converging from all directions. Soon, Olympia will
      be encircled.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Our defenses can handle Nemestra, but the combined might of the rogue beasts
      will overwhelm us. We must shift the battlefield.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: The celestial fragment. We use it as a beacon, lead them away from the
      city.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: It's a gambit, but it could just tip the scales. Draw them out into open
      ground.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: I'll spearhead the diversion. They want the fragment? They can come get
      it.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Side by side, Atlas. We'll make them regret ever setting their sights on
      Olympia.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: I'll oversee the operation, ensuring our movements remain cohesive. Timing
      is crucial. Okay, Let's do this!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0585d2520385f4cada70b2afee8ae30a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
